[525.366804, "o", "\u001b]0;student@6312vm-csr01: ~\u0007student@6312vm-csr01:~$ "]
[525.367972, "o", "configured, and RESTCONF is no exception. One thing unique about RESTCONF is that it lacks any true \"API"]
[525.368409, "o", "\r\n"]
[525.36899, "o", "> "]
[525.369796, "o", "Documentation\" that a developer would use to learn about leveraging it. Rather, the YANG Models"]
